extends SceneTree
## GENERATED by tools/export/make_capture_reference.py from tools/art/capture_lookdev.gd.
## Reference frames of the frozen Godot project at the runtime's first gate size (3024x1964),
## all twelve review cameras. godot --path . --script tools/export/capture_reference.gd -- --out=<new-dir>
## godot --path . --script tools/art/capture_lookdev.gd -- --out=<new-dir> --suite=full
## Or: --job=res://art/lookdev/capture_job.json (specified fields override CLI options).

